message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"**Considering skill modification**\\n\\nI need to modify a skill, and I'm wondering if I should use the skill-creator tool. The user seems to be asking for a modification related to a kidney skill, which makes me think of kidney-cancer-detection. This tool seems to be about improving or editing existing skills. I should look more closely at that specific skill to understand how I can effectively make the necessary updates.\",\"thinkingSignature\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0f6fd7f0a916ebe60169bab3697a808191ac37816e34ce8ce7\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"encrypted_content\\\":\\\"gAAAAABpurNsIZgL2udVLyTRBmY864lxW0yvYmsz4U1vbOvdyx6u0xBx3lQuIDXVPk-QT6VB82bYG-ypv_DQbGmPhGD5VWCzEx2xL_XHyB3tK7UVu_gaHeJPi1DHJah4MNuW63wMK0QTCoKq4BCPJ62wzo3oReYmkxiy1Qrp6_D8TmpoKuOLYqawTI3SmVn4aBgzYpia20_jVcVam9Rg6KhW96xhwo9DSfLf18I-SFzW0Mdz71SlzFYfqVV8poO3UfQu9uqSNQWts-ZoihD3GjnK733NvPeGNs4fnFrdFuLEibfNm-EX4lHpXqpbBSKRWOS3BJ2ICivKz_6taRvTq5wkW0i1dHOTo6Q07K1-fEefY1PKo6ND0ugeyMVsCSmZs42g-IMDxdUNNsKV5W0o-WLHcloJA_EL9nnfL2T6tPaJB97MiWISzHt1sZYHOvr3H2HUvLenQ0thqBiflF16HFYmyi5_AR7UUqTFnF2uMMZSTgaTq7t83iIKQDCUq61EPsGsQyIaNUfaPfQ6pD5plEgFb-Cfg7P-L3X6f8Sc_VtWsll84QYZFLFiAvtw3ubJotxvXb0aIhmyS6H_N61zkuFCwsaXuJKuPP_6kHDhSlQNP93PVXXGCK2-Ifd1z2gtEHypXPe0qKbHalSTrFCIAdXwg8CCXSZ1nhsHJ_Y-ziEjd5whxyHMwz-L-sWWG0PnqHxUdDOeqnZZhYFiYoBVu-kMjLrrk1b3Bn7nFiQ5922TU42TzYj18xQQ8D6zG6qeCXYJLFaJZOpG1HmTANZweY4teJZUAiAk303UfxiGuKF6tsPExF78xSsWdoRsbTouM1mztQlaOm1T0Ba8H5g9iCJf29Q_GERK1HxeARixClMlxawAGMl8va0sT2V6ZE3HO7hud_tFu2k8kTR3GVa-g-WJitCsevExjO9mmjeMLysG5PR448eYyCdjTmZwDG4W0BG3OtPCicJ_haiUKBWQdl5uIupuNW7zvmYPc8CdP7anBjfDzQVSebH0nCxgQf2v1Q5dkvNhMmMzVnxpfVkzkho9WT3zO-ofRDN8pJvNIck0kVWSvwakMlVEXI0IuwoENS6rbdpuvP7EBME9m1YmhN7wBszAoAsfwNJn2kqPiaK7mwosE--OvdbVixq7Xbz8e4uMqGf3rDXQQ0dFLXClbfqj8JMx5_nsBtQafapPDt6dGdEFfvh9zcB22y8n4JLF3MEjDaLA-W1gDHTj93Pcfy6yk-lHV-uySH-6wwAy-CQm7NES-82MYcs=\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"summary_text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"**Considering skill modification**\\\\n\\\\nI need to modify a skill, and I'm wondering if I should use the skill-creator tool. The user seems to be asking for a modification related to a kidney skill, which makes me think of kidney-cancer-detection. This tool seems to be about improving or editing existing skills. I should look more closely at that specific skill to understand how I can effectively make the necessary updates.\\\"}]}\"},{\"type\":\"toolCall\",\"id\":\"call_a6RgTgsx0DSzhgNNoawapoVe|fc_0f6fd7f0a916ebe60169bab36c19ec819194c59c7e5ede223b\",\"name\":\"read\",\"arguments\":{\"file_path\":\"/app/skills/skill-creator/SKILL.md\"},\"partialJson\":\"{\\\"file_path\\\":\\\"/app/skills/skill-creator/SKILL.md\\\"}\"}],\"api\":\"openai-codex-responses\",\"provider\":\"openai-codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"usage\":{\"input\":8337,\"output\":101,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":8438,\"cost\":{\"input\":0.020842500000000003,\"output\":0.001515,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0.022357500000000002}},\"stopReason\":\"toolUse\",\"timestamp\":1773843304294}}\n/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/a4f8b130-088f-49a6-839c-b46a599ebc83.jsonl:11:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"45f03aba\",\"parentId\":\"00b06956\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-18T14:15:16.844Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_cZN9vAfPeDoGIsGqKHHoaNgJ|fc_0f6fd7f0a916ebe60169bab374ca2c81919c6dccacae6d7b87\",\"toolName\":\"read\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"---\\nname: kidney-cancer-detection\\ndescription: Use this skill when the user wants to analyze a kidney medical image for possible kidney cancer detection, classify the result, or route a kidney image through the upload API and then into the kidney cancer prediction endpoint using the returned remote image path.\\n---\\n\\n# Kidney Cancer Detection\\n\\nUpload the local image first, then run inference with the uploaded remote path.\\n\\n## Workflow\\n\\n1. Determine the local image to analyze.\\n   - Prefer an explicit local file path when one is available.\\n   - If no path is provided, use the most recent supported image under `./config/media/inbound`.\\n2. Require the Telegram user id.\\n   - Pass it as `--telegram-user-id` or set `TELEGRAM_USER_ID`.\\n   - Use that value as the upload request's `user_id` query parameter.\\n3. Upload the image with a `POST multipart/form-data` request to:\\n   - `http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/nodes/input/upload?storage_ref=nodes_bucket&local_file_path=upload%2F&user_id=<telegram-user-id>`\\n4. Read the upload response JSON and build the new remote `image_path` by concatenating:\\n   - `path + filename`\\n5. Call the kidney cancer inference endpoint using that uploaded `image_path`.\\n\\n## Fixed request values\\n\\nKeep these values static:\\n- `storage_ref`: `nodes_bucket`\\n- `local_file_path`: `upload/`\\n- inference endpoint `data.storage_ref`: `nodes_bucket`\\n\\n## What this skill runs\\n\\n```bash\\npython3 scripts/kidney_cancer_tool.py --telegram-user-id <telegram-user-id> [local-image-path]\\n```\\n\\nIf `local-image-path` is omitted, the script automatically selects the newest supported image from `./config/media/inbound`.\\n\\n## Upload response handling\\n\\nGiven an upload response like:\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"path\\\": \\\"upload/2026-03-15_14.52.42_5EdSbYnzCrKdhainPvGx/\\\",\\n  \\\"filename\\\": \\\"9dd106ff-65ad-4a16-a381-6d76e4845c9c.jpg\\\",\\n  \\\"column_names\\\": null\\n}\\n```\\n\\nBuild:\\n\\n```text\\nimage_path = \\\"upload/2026-03-15_14.52.42_5EdSbYnzCrKdhainPvGx/9dd106ff-65ad-4a16-a381-6d76e4845c9c.jpg\\\"\\n```\\n\\nUse that full value as the inference request's `data.image_path`.\\n\\n## Expected output\\n\\nReturn validated JSON with this shape:\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"uploaded_image_path\\\": \\\"string\\\",\\n  \\\"prediction_label\\\": \\\"string\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": 0.98\\n}\\n```\\n\"}],\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1773843316835}}\n/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/a4f8b130-088f-49a6-839c-b46a599ebc83.jsonl:12:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"33ae4257\",\"parentId\":\"45f03aba\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-18T14:15:16.853Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_W0xXHsmy5hV2jpaTmuLemfRa|fc_0f6fd7f0a916ebe60169bab374ca3c81918e9e210a4f7344fa\",\"toolName\":\"exec\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/SKILL.md\\n/home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/scripts/__pycache__/kidney_cancer_tool.cpython-311.pyc\\n/home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/scripts/kidney_cancer_tool.py\"}],\"details\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"exitCode\":0,\"durationMs\":13,\"aggregated\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/SKILL.md\\n/home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/scripts/__pycache__/kidney_cancer_tool.cpython-311.pyc\\n/home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-cancer-detector/scripts/kidney_cancer_tool.py\",\"cwd\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace\"},\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1773843316849}}\n/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/a4f8b130-088f-49a6-839c-b46a599ebc83.jsonl:13:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"c752d9f6\",\"parentId\":\"33ae4257\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-18T14:15:24.588Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"**Inspecting script**\\n\\nI need to take a closer look at the script. I'm curious about what specific aspects need inspecting, whether it's functionality, potential errors, or improving efficiency. I wonder if there's any specific feedback I should consider while reviewing it. This sounds straightforward, but I'm also aware that it could lead to unexpected insights or issues I hadn’t thought of. I’ll focus on understanding it fully!\",\"thinkingSignature\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0f6fd7f0a916ebe60169bab37a68808191abab09822f415b5d\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"encrypted_content\\\":\\\"gAAAAABpurN8B6FJPgRalCi2WdnIjFO